  "description": "This drag mat has a wide size of 6 x 3 feet, this drag mat enables faster and more efficient work completion. The hinges are crafted to bend, ensuring the mesh stays on the ground during dragging, enhancing its effectiveness in leveling and grading tasks. Despite its efficiency, the lightweight drag mat weighs only 38 pounds.\nFitment\nThis drag mat offers a wide range of uses, including leveling driveways, yards, and baseball diamonds, grading fine soil, creating food plots, maintaining parking lots, and handling infield jobs with ease.\nFeatures\nVersatile Applications: The drag mat can be used to level driveways, yards, and baseball diamonds, as well as grade fine soil, create food plots, maintain parking lots, and handle other infield jobs\nDurable Construction: Made from heavy-duty steel mesh, the drag mat is durable and reliable for completing various tasks\nRust Resistance: The zinc-plated finish and durable construction ensure that the drag-mat will resist rust for extended use\nConvenient Manual Pulling: The included tow rope allows for easy manual drag mat pulling\nEfficient Work Completion: Wide sweeping size of 6 x 3 feet achieves faster working efficiency; Its hinges are designed to bend, keeping the mesh on the ground when being dragged to enhance effectiveness; Drag mat weight is 38 pounds",
